Pain in my ass sticking up my ass

Says, Face it!

Let it go, embrace the pain, don't run away from it

That's your ass, not my ass, don't run away from yourself

Don't take it personal, that's just all you, your fear, your anger; don't project it on me

But where's the self while fear and tension are causing the pain?

Is it in the pain, or is it in my ass?

Distraction stiffens my ass

Auch!

I jumped

Pain in my ass, pain in my ass
